| pid | name              | brand     | quantity | unit | category | price | retailer  |
+-----+-------------------+-----------+----------+------+----------+-------+-----------+
| 101 | Lactantia 2% Milk | Lactantia |    2.000 | L    | Dairy    |  5.49 | No Frills |
| 101 | Lactantia 2% Milk | Lactantia |    2.000 | L    | Dairy    |  5.99 | Sobeys    |
| 101 | Lactantia 2% Milk | Lactantia |    2.000 | L    | Dairy    |  5.29 | Walmart   |
+-----+-------------------+-----------+----------+------+----------+-------+-----------+
3 rows in set (0.002 sec)

